<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Jesus bids us shine, then, for all around</l><l>Many kinds of darkness in this world abound—</l><l>Sin and want and sorrow; we must shine,</l><l>You in your small corner, and I in mine.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
